- op: discuss  # 6ad6
  at: '2026-03-20T20:59:44Z'  # 6ad6
  by: agent  # 6ad6
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6ad6
  clock: 2  # 6ad6
  nonce: 6ad6  # 6ad6
  message: "Bakeoff finding (deep-20260320-163609): When a Java native method leads to a C function that calls fopen/fread/write, the IO chain should be visible in io-boundaries with entry_points populated from the Java side. Currently JNI bridge edges are not followed during IO boundary traversal. Affects JNA (65% JNI coverage), netty (custom native naming), and other JNI-heavy repos."  # 6ad6
